WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.088
These are the rows this chapter adds.

2
00:00:02.088 --> 00:00:07.001
On SailPoint, a token from an API client,
then Search with the search read scope,

3
00:00:07.001 --> 00:00:11.762
and the Accounts list and single-account
read with the accounts read scope.

4
00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:15.711
Workflow creation needs a manage
scope, and it's its own task,

5
00:00:15.711 --> 00:00:18.612
because no client in
the kit makes that call.

6
00:00:18.612 --> 00:00:23.665
On Graph, listing users and reading one
user both need User dot Read dot All as an

7
00:00:23.665 --> 00:00:26.851
application permission,
and the directory audit,

8
00:00:26.851 --> 00:00:30.100
which is optional, needs
AuditLog dot Read dot All.
